{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of Gumrock Grotto, lil guys await your command. The darkness and monsters around them do nothing to dampen their spirits, for they are made of rocks. Driven by pure instinct, they obey your commands without hesitation. They may be empty-headed, and boy are they lil, but in great numbers they can dig, build castles, and defend their king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636800/extras/bc0a8308979da5f4beae920212968495.poster.avif?t=1760650342\" width=720 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636800/extras/bc0a8308979da5f4beae920212968495.webm?t=1760650342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636800/extras/bc0a8308979da5f4beae920212968495.mp4?t=1760650342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terraform the world, harvest its resources, and build a prosperous kingdom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your lil guys to work with intuitive controls. They long for the mines. Reshape the world to keep your king safe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Defend against enemies big and small. Use the items they drop to craft a stronger and more fashionable defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight back against waves of monsters, each with their own unique abilities and attack strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct buildings to expand the functionality of your kingdom. Store and craft new items, automate healing and defenses, manage the efficiency of your Lil Guys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Above all else, make more and more lil guys! Adorn them with equipment to change their behavior.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2636800?t=1760650342","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2636800?t=1760650342","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636800/ce19cfc618ce7662878fd258348f3a17bcc815b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760650342","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636800/ce19cfc618ce7662878fd258348f3a17bcc815b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760650342","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of Gumrock Grotto, lil guys await your command. The darkness and monsters around them do nothing to dampen their spirits, for they are made of rocks. Driven by pure instinct, they obey your commands without hesitation. They may be empty-headed, and boy are they lil, but in great numbers they can dig, build castles, and defend their king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636800/extras/bc0a8308979da5f4beae920212968495.poster.avif?t=1760650342\" width=720 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636800/extras/bc0a8308979da5f4beae920212968495.webm?t=1760650342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636800/extras/bc0a8308979da5f4beae920212968495.mp4?t=1760650342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terraform the world, harvest its resources, and build a prosperous kingdom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your lil guys to work with intuitive controls. They long for the mines. Reshape the world to keep your king safe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Defend against enemies big and small. Use the items they drop to craft a stronger and more fashionable defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight back against waves of monsters, each with their own unique abilities and attack strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct buildings to expand the functionality of your kingdom. Store and craft new items, automate healing and defenses, manage the efficiency of your Lil Guys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Above all else, make more and more lil guys! Adorn them with equipment to change their behavior.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Radnyx"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636800/header.jpg?t=1760650342","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2636800/790578/fc34c0340934d0725007f102362653c74bf4f272/1750938348/dash_av1.mpd?t=1732510073","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2636800/790578/fc34c0340934d0725007f102362653c74bf4f272/1750938348/dash_h264.mpd?t=1732510073","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2636800/790578/fc34c0340934d0725007f102362653c74bf4f272/1750938348/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1732510073","id":257076333,"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257076333/55bef940674b1cbc4450c125516a426924acf43d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1732510073"}],"name":"Lil Guys","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> WIndows 10, 8, 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5<br></li><li><strong>Mem